{"type":"thought","data":"This is a plan audit."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The target document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe prompt spec is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.10, but the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims to mirror v1.7."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Several functional "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requirements and acceptance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria have been "}
{"type":"thought","data":"added since then, including"}
{"type":"thought","data":" D-15, D-16, AC-1.3,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-7.3, and FR-2 halts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" named. These gaps will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" likely be classified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as must-fix.\n\nThe spec explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires the plan to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" adopt FR-4, FR-5, FR-7,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and FR-10. These obligations"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are listed in the \"Owed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by other documents\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" section. The plan is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" therefore stale."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI need to verify the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" actual plan and spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" versions. I will check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for internal contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" within the plan against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the inlined v1.10 spec."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I also need to confirm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the on-disk plan matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the inlined version."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-1 is partially "}
{"type":"thought","data":"absent. The plan lists"}
{"type":"thought","data":" four optional fields"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and omits the fifth,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `implementation_authors`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which the spec requires."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The remaining FR-1 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requirements are covered."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-1 is classified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as restated. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits the fifth optional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" field required by the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current spec, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicitly demands "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`implementation_authors`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when the plan carries"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-1's field list."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-1 is restated and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" narrower. The plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"includes an attribution"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture in stage 7,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but it omits the full"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-7.3 requirements."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-2 is absent. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec v1.10 defines "}
{"type":"thought","data":"three named halts for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" step5: implementer_invalid,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementer_unresolved,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and implementer_switch_unrecorded."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan stage 2 only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" describes moving env-var"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and PATH evaluation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" into the judge.\n\nThe plan cites AC-2.1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and AC-2.2 as satisfying"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-2, yet it never "}
{"type":"thought","data":"names the three required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" halt tokens. It describes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the resolution function"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and CLI verb at a high"}
{"type":"thought","data":" level, but omits the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" halt contract entirely."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-3 appears fully"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implemented-as-written"}
{"type":"thought","data":" relative to the v1.7"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec, with no substantive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" changes in later versions."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-4 introduces several"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new requirements: every"}
{"type":"thought","data":" deny carries a kind,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" activity reading uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a three-valued scan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" where unknown fires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" denies, directory targets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are handled per D-16,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" empty target keys count"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as no path key, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root canonicalisation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" produces a deny.\n\nThe agy gate in stage"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 5 is too brief. It "}
{"type":"thought","data":"omits the required deny"}
{"type":"thought","data":" kinds, three-valued"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unknown scan, directory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" targets, and empty "}
{"type":"thought","data":"path key handling."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" limits its decisions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to D-1 through D-14."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It does not recognize"}
{"type":"thought","data":" D-15 or D-16. This "}
{"type":"thought","data":"confirms the plan is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" locked to spec v1.7"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the inlined spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is v1.10."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-5 is now under "}
{"type":"thought","data":"review. The spec v1.10"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires the gate --self-check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verdict FAIL to exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0, plus AC-5.2's self-check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture. The plan stage"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 5 text mentions exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" codes and the audit-gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" signal discipline, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"but I am carefully checking"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether it explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" adopts the FAIL-exit-0"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule.\n\nFR-5 contains a direct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan states that `AGY-GATE:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" UNREADABLE` exits 1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the check, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec v1.10 requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code 2."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe contradiction "}
{"type":"thought","data":"in FR-5 is confirmed."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's \"Operational"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors exit 2\" heading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicitly states that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `AGY-GATE: UNREADABLE`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exits 1 from the check,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which directly contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec table requiring"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code 2. This is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both an internal inconsistency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and a spec restatement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI need to verify the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on-disk plan file matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the prompt text. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan also diverges "}
{"type":"thought","data":"from the spec in its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" wiring hook: it returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0 on WIRING: FAIL and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 on WIRING: UNKNOWN,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which conflicts with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec's exit-code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe FR-5 contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a build defect. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"If implementers follow"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan, their tests"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will diverge from the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec by expecting exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code 1 instead of 2"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for UNREADABLE. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must be fixed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's version"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history explicitly "}
{"type":"thought","data":"records exit code 2 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"for UNREADABLE, confirming"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the body's exit-1 statement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a persistent typo."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This deepens the FR-5"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction.\n\nFR-6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now under review."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan covers the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shared module from "}
{"type":"thought","data":"D-12, but spec v1.8 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"adds that unknown scan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" results deny every "}
{"type":"thought","data":"run_command without "}
{"type":"thought","data":"judging."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-6 is restated. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The plan's stage 4 only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" covers the shared module"}
{"type":"thought","data":" move, not the unknown-scan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shell deny required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by spec v1.8.\n\nFR-7"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now under review."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Spec v1.9 changed the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" attribution source "}
{"type":"thought","data":"to `implementation_authors`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the plan stage "}
{"type":"thought","data":"7 still defines the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementer as the agent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whose dispatch produced"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the code.\n\nFR-7 is restated. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The plan's stage 7 fixture"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only covers the routing-is-not-authorship"}
{"type":"thought","data":" case. AC-7.3 requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" five fixtures, including"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pre-field, multi-author"}
{"type":"thought","data":" recovered, RED is not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" authorship, and unaccepted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" dispatches. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" carries one fixture"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and omits the rest."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's stage 7"}
{"type":"thought","data":" attribution logic is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" narrower than the spec."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It reads the implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the dispatch record,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the spec requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `implementation_authors`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and does not name a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" durable store."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-8 appears fully"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan covers post-merge,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version stamps, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" step 2a, and the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.7 requirements remain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" largely unchanged."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-9 is restated. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The plan stage 6 differential"}
{"type":"thought","data":" corpus adds a fifth"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `other-symbol` fixture"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that the spec table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe fifth `other-symbol`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture is additional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scope, not a restatement."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It narrows the pass"}
{"type":"thought","data":" condition by requiring"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one more case to keep"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its verdict unchanged,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which remains compatible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the spec."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe fifth `other-symbol`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture is an explicit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" addition, not a silent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" narrowing. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" states it adds a fifth"}
{"type":"thought","data":" case, so this is additional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scope rather than a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restatement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `other-symbol`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture is distinct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the spec's `unrelated-import`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" case. It covers a typo"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the test rather "}
{"type":"thought","data":"than a missing third-party"}
{"type":"thought","data":" module."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `other-symbol`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture may be a restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the corpus boundary."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The spec only permits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a fifth NameError case"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when the rule treats"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it differently, yet"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan adds this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"case unconditionally."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe fifth `other-symbol`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture is a build "}
{"type":"thought","data":"defect. It requires "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementers to write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a test case the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not require, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" risks widening the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"rule or causing corpus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" failures. The classification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" depends on whether "}
{"type":"thought","data":"this makes the entire"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-9 restated, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would be a must-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" under Axis C."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe fifth `other-symbol`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture is not a restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of FR-9. It is additional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scope that does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" narrow the spec. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan's five-case pass"}
{"type":"thought","data":" condition is compatible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the spec's four-case"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement if the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"extra case's verdict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stays unchanged. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" divergence should be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" classified as a should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or must-fix depending"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on whether it alters"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the pass predicate."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-9 is implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan explicitly"}
