o fires on unknown, class-(b) production .py still read through read_chain under inactive; workspacePaths and Tool classes sentences re-worded. E5 -> FR-4 Target keys: a non-empty-string value counts as no path key. S4 -> FR-4 'Deliberate differences from the Codex gate': design's four adopted plus the kind rule as a fifth. S2/E2/E4 -> FR-7 Attribution sub-bullets (5e GREEN + accepted fixes, never 5d RED; complete author set, never a projection) and new AC-7.3. S5 -> adopted: reviewer none of the authors names the latest accepted dispatch's [... truncated (1031 chars total)]"}]}]},"locations":[]}
